<title>CANADA: Canada June natural gas sales rise 9.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada June natural gas sales rise 9.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian sales of natural gas rose 9.3 percent in June from the same month a year earlier, to 3,667,695 thousand cubic metres, Statistics Canada said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Thousands of cubic meters and percentage changes:</p>
<p>					June 97     June 96	Pct</p>
<p>Total			     3,667,695    3,356,857   +9.3</p>
<p>Residential sales		 534,993	494,384   +8.2</p>
<p>Commercial sales		  386,328	361,689   +6.8</p>
<p>Industrial			1,757,983    1,646,317   +9.8</p>
<p>Direct sales			988,391	854,467     -</p>
<p>    Year to date:		 1997	   1996	 Pct</p>
<p>Total			    37,823,354   36,909,890   +2.5</p>
<p>Residential sales	    10,618,612   10,717,279   -0.9</p>
<p>Commercial sales		7,509,503    7,636,988   -1.7</p>
<p>Industrial		     12,591,851   12,364,382   +6.1</p>
<p>Direct sales		    7,103,388    6,191,241     -</p>
<p>(NOTE - Percentage rise for industrial sales encompasses direct sales as well.)</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Gary Smalldridge, Energy Section, at 613-951-3567)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613- 235-6745))</p>
